# This repo ships ONLY the browser extension, the BOID template, and the docs.
# Strategy: ignore everything at the root, then re-include exactly what we send.

/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/LICENSE
!/BOID.template.xlsx
!/meroshare-extension/

# (Inside meroshare-extension/, its own .gitignore drops verify/node_modules and
#  generated dev artifacts. A real BOID list, if ever placed here, stays ignored
#  by the /* rule above — only BOID.template.xlsx is whitelisted.)
